sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Native iOS / Android app
  participant Edge as Cloudflare edge
  participant Registry as Region discovery service
  participant API as Tenant home-region mobile API
  participant DB as Regional database
  participant Store as Regional encrypted object store
  participant Push as APNs / FCM

  App->>Edge: Resolve global app API host
  Edge->>Registry: Route region discovery request
  Registry-->>App: Signed tenant region and API base URL
  App->>Edge: OAuth PKCE authorization and token request
  Edge->>API: Authenticated /api/mobile/v1 request
  API->>DB: Authorize by tenant, role, region, and order scope
  DB-->>API: Authorized data only
  API-->>App: Regional API response with correlation ID
  App->>API: Create resumable upload session
  API-->>App: Short-lived regional upload target
  App->>Store: Background/resumable upload
  Store-->>API: Object-complete event
  API->>Push: Minimal notification request
  Push-->>App: Generic notification only
